13	 * {@link ValidateOwnerFields}, which republishes it as a variable (so this step does not
14	 * bind {@code @RequestBody} a second time).
15	 *
16	 * <p>When the request supplies no registration date, it defaults to the server's current
17	 * date so every created owner has a {@code registrationDate}.
